  "en|zh-CN|h1|The Cycloid: A Curve of Remarkable Properties": "摆线：一条具有显著性质的曲线",
  "en|zh-CN|p|An introduction to the geometry and mathematical properties of the cycloid.": "介绍摆线的几何和数学性质。",
  "en|zh-CN|p|Published: 2026/11/10": "发布时间：2026/11/10",
  "en|zh-CN|h1|The Cycloid": "Cycloid",
  "en|zh-CN|p|A cycloid is the curve traced by a fixed point on the circumference of a circle as the circle rolls along a straight line without slipping.": "摆线是当圆沿着直线滚动而不滑动时，由圆周上的一个固定点描绘的曲线。",
  "en|zh-CN|p|It is a fascinating curve with connections to geometry, calculus, mechanics, and the brachistochrone problem.": "这是一条迷人的曲线，与几何、微积分、力学和短时线问题有关。",
  "en|zh-CN|h2|Parametric equations": "参数方程",
  "en|zh-CN|p|For a circle of radius (r), the cycloid can be described parametrically by:": "对于半径为（r）的圆，摆线可以参数化地描述为：",
  "en|zh-CN|p|$$\nx = r(t-\\sin t)\n$$": "$$\nx=r（t-\\sin t）\n$$",
  "en|zh-CN|p|$$\ny = r(1-\\cos t)\n$$": "$$\ny=r（1-\\cos t）\n$$",
  "en|zh-CN|p|Here, (t) is the angle through which the circle has rotated.": "这里，（t）是圆旋转的角度。",
  "en|zh-CN|h2|Why is it interesting?": "为什么它很有趣？",
  "en|zh-CN|p|The cycloid appears in several famous mathematical problems, including the brachistochrone problem: finding the curve along which a particle slides under gravity in the shortest possible time.": "摆线出现在几个著名的数学问题中，包括短时线问题：在尽可能短的时间内找到粒子在重力作用下滑动的曲线。",
